# Assets the build reads verbatim. Marked binary so that git does not try to diff
# them and does not rewrite their line endings: a font or a compiled catalogue that
# has had its bytes adjusted is no longer the file the engine was built to read.
*.ttf   binary
*.png   binary
*.jpg   binary
*.dat   binary
*.mo    binary
*.wasm  binary

# The generated tables carry #line directives that name the sources they came
# from; they are written with LF and stay that way.
*.inc   text eol=lf
